## Rules

- NEVER create or use `~/lg` as a workspace
- All monorepo commands run from `~/livegrid`:
  - `pnpm install`
  - `pnpm --filter web exec tsc --noEmit`
  - `pnpm --filter api exec tsc --noEmit`
  - `pnpm --filter @lg/database exec prisma migrate deploy`
- Legacy Laravel code remains under `app/`, `routes/`, etc. (not active stack)
